extends layout

block content
  .row.banner
    .col-12
      h1= title

  .row
    .col-12.col-lg-8
      .card.mb-4
        .card-body
          h2.card-title 
            i.fa.fa-info-circle.mr-2
            | About Us
          p Welcome to our Hospital Appointment Management System! Our goal is to streamline the process of scheduling appointments, ensuring that you receive timely and efficient healthcare services. We are dedicated to making it easier for patients to connect with healthcare providers when they need it most.
      
      .card.mb-4
        .card-body
          h2.card-title 
            i.fa.fa-book.mr-2
            | Our Story
          p Founded with a commitment to improving patient care, we understand the challenges individuals face when trying to secure timely appointments. Our platform was developed to eliminate the hassle of waiting on the phone or in long lines, providing a seamless experience for both patients and healthcare professionals.
      
      .card.mb-4
        .card-body
          h2.card-title 
            i.fa.fa-handshake.mr-2
            | What We Offer
          ul
            li 
              strong User-Friendly Interface: 
              | Our intuitive design allows patients to quickly navigate and book appointments with ease.
            li 
              strong Real-Time Availability: 
              | Check the latest availability of healthcare providers and schedule your visit at your convenience.
            li 
              strong Secure Management: 
              | We prioritize your privacy and security, ensuring that your personal information is handled with the utmost care.
            li 
              strong Verified Information: 
              | All hospital information is verified and regularly updated for accuracy.
            li 
              strong Patient Reviews: 
              | Read real reviews from other patients to make informed decisions.
      
      .card
        .card-body
          h2.card-title 
            i.fa.fa-heart.mr-2
            | Our Commitment
          p We are committed to enhancing the healthcare experience for patients and providers alike. Our team continually seeks to improve our system and introduce new features that make scheduling appointments more efficient. We value your feedback and are here to assist you with any questions or concerns.
          p.text-center.mt-4
            strong Thank you for choosing our Hospital Appointment Management System! We look forward to helping you receive the care you need when you need it.